ou're on long trips, at the office, or working out, the music never stops. These Bluetooth earbuds seamlessly connect with iOS, Android, and Windows devices, ensuring easy pairing with phones, tablets, and laptops", "IPX7 waterproof, all-scenario ready: The running headphones, rigorously tested, meet IPX7 standards, shrugging off sweat, rain, and splashes. They stay reliable during high-intensity workouts, outdoor rides, or rainy commutes. These sport earbuds adopt a lightweight design with a stable ear hook, which will not fall off during intense exercise. They are suitable for running, fitness, cycling and other scenes, making your passion unlimited."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41kcQwnlUTL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0FD8T8Q89	in_stock	2026-02-03 16:42:58.078521	2026-01-30 01:42:35.284213	f	DUSONLAP	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a65bda2696c7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0FD8T8Q89&bf=0.1&fbu=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0FD8T8Q89&cuid=amazon_B0FD8T8Q89&utm_source=dropiq_search&utm_medium=product_listing&utm_campaign=amazon	\N	\N	0.6500	0.60	0.13	1499.00	f	32	f	0.60	f	Blue	\N	f	True Wireless Earbuds
