75992a68-d287-486e-943c-c5d91a3eedc8	KZ Castor Pro in Ear Monitor, Dual 10mm Dynamic Driver, Harman Target Hi-Res Audio Quality, 4 Tuning Switch, Oxygen Free Copper Flat Cable, 0.78mm 2Pin & 3.5mm Plug Compatible	B0DQV8XG36	headphones	1859	4.2	965	\N	["DUAL-CORE MASSIVE 10MM DYNAMIC DRIVER FOR POWERFUL SOUND: The KZ Castor Pro In-Ear Monitor (IEM) redefines what an earphone can be, moving beyond the limitations of a single dynamic driver. Featuring a revolutionary dual-core 10mm dynamic driver, the Castor Pro Wired IEM offers an exceptional audio experience. Specifically designed for ultra-low frequencies, this driver expertly handles sub-bass and bass output, delivering deep, resonant lows with a powerful, responsive rebound that elevates every beat.", "ADVANCED ACOUSTIC ENGINEER FOR MUSICIANS: KZ Castor Pro IEM is an upgraded version of KZ Castor which is designed with the needs of professional musicians in mind, the KZ Castor Pro combines advanced electronic crossover technology with a precision four-level tuning filter. Every component is carefully crafted to provide a perfect balance of bass, midrange, and treble, delivering a complete Hi-Fi sound experience. Its dual-driver system creates a rich, high-fidelity sound, offering the perfect balance, clarity, and power—everything required for an unforgettable stage performance.", "HARMAN TARGET / HARMAN TARGET WITH IMPROVED BASS VERSION FOR MUSIC CUSTOMIZED: The KZ Castor Pro IEM redefines personalization, offering two distinct versions to perfectly match your musical style. Whether you prefer balanced precision or crave a richer bass experience, these IEM provide unparalleled versatility with their innovative 4-level tuning switches.", "Harman Target Version: Crafted for purity and balance, this version lets you fine-tune your sound with ease: Switch 1 On (Bass +1dB) | Switch 1&2 On (Bass +2dB) | Switch 1&2&3 On (Mid & High +1dB) | Switch 1&2&3&4 On (Mid & High +2dB). The Castor Pro refines the frequency response to better match the Harman target curve, enhancing performance and setting a new standard for sound quality.", "Harman Target with Enhanced Bass Version: Designed for those who love deeper, more resonant lows, this version offers: Switch 1 On (Bass +1dB) | Switch 1&2 On (Bass +2dB) | Switch 3 On (Mid & High +1dB) | Switch 3&4 On (Mid & High +2dB). The Harman Curve Bass-Enhanced version boosts sensitivity and dynamic low-frequency performance while maintaining the Harman curve's clarity in mid and high frequencies for a substantial overall sound quality improvement.", "FOUR-LEVEL ADJUSTABLE TUNING SWITCH FOR PERSONALIZED SOUND: The KZ Castor Pro IEM is equipped with a high-precision acoustic tuning switch. Activate Switch 1 (Boosts low frequency by 1 level) Activate Switch 1+2 (Boosts low frequency by 2 levels) Activate Switch 3 (Enhances mid-high frequency by 1 level) Activate Switch 3+4 (Enhances mid-high frequency by 2 levels) Activate all switches (Boosts overall frequency for a full-range experience)", "ZINC ALLOY CASING & TIMELESS ERGONOMIC COMFORT: The KZ Castor Pro In-Ear Monitor (IEM) offers a perfect blend of durability and elegance with its zinc alloy casing, adding a touch of luxury to every use. It’s ergonomic design, paired with soft, skin-friendly silicone ear tips, ensures a comfortable, snug fit, making long listening sessions feel effortless and enjoyable.", "HIGH-PURITY OXYGEN-FREE COPPER CABLE: The KZ Castor Pro IEM earphones stand for a commitment to quality and innovation. Featuring an OFC (Oxygen-Free Copper) core, the cable ensures precise, clear sound for an immersive experience. Wrapped in a durable, transparent TPE sheath, it’s built to last, resisting bends and pulls. Also easily manages music, calls, and voice commands with one-touch control, while the built-in microphone delivers clear, natural audio for seamless communication. KZ delivers the perfect mix of performance and reliability, crafted for music lovers who expect the best."]	\N