ure grip and passive noise isolation for uninterrupted listening. These wireless neckband earphones are perfectly compatible with Bullets Wireless Z3 style devices and ideal for users looking for a reliable, high-performance audio solution. If you want a perfect combination of deep bass, long battery life, fast charging, clear calling, and immersive audio, these earphones are the ultimate upgrade for your daily lifestyle.	["Advanced wireless neckband earphones equipped with powerful 12.4mm dynamic drivers deliver exceptionally deep bass, rich sound clarity, and enhanced audio performance, making them ideal for music lovers, gamers, and users who demand premium sound quality in daily usage.", "Experience next-level immersive audio with advanced 3D spatial sound technology that creates a surround sound effect, allowing you to feel every beat, dialogue, and sound detail clearly while enjoying movies, gaming sessions, or high-quality music playback.", "Ultra-fast charging technology ensures maximum convenience by providing up to 27 hours of continuous playback with just 10 minutes of quick charging, making these earphones a perfect choice for long travel, busy work schedules, and extended daily use.", "Built-in AI-powered noise cancellation technology enhances call quality by effectively reducing unwanted background noise, ensuring your voice remains clear and audible during calls, online meetings, gaming chats, and voice communication in any environment.", "Multiple EQ sound presets allow users to customize their listening experience by switching between bass-enhanced mode, balanced sound output, vocal clarity mode, and immersive audio settings based on their personal preference and content type.", "Ergonomically designed lightweight neckband offers superior comfort and flexibility for long hours of usage, while the in-ear earbuds provide a secure fit and passive noise isolation for uninterrupted listening without discomfort or ear fatigue.", "Magnetic earbuds design a