frequency response to better match the Harman target curve, enhancing performance and setting a new standard for sound quality.", "Harman Target with Enhanced Bass Version: Designed for those who love deeper, more resonant lows, this version offers: Switch 1 On (Bass +1dB) | Switch 1&2 On (Bass +2dB) | Switch 3 On (Mid & High +1dB) | Switch 3&4 On (Mid & High +2dB). The Harman Curve Bass-Enhanced version boosts sensitivity and dynamic low-frequency performance while maintaining the Harman curve's clarity in mid and high frequencies for a substantial overall sound quality improvement.", "FOUR-LEVEL ADJUSTABLE TUNING SWITCH FOR PERSONALIZED SOUND: The KZ Castor Pro IEM is equipped with a high-precision acoustic tuning switch. Activate Switch 1 (Boosts low frequency by 1 level) Activate Switch 1+2 (Boosts low frequency by 2 levels) Activate Switch 3 (Enhances mid-high frequency by 1 level) Activate Switch 3+4 (Enhances mid-high frequency by 2 levels) Activate all switches (Boosts overall frequency for a full-range experience)", "ZINC ALLOY CASING & TIMELESS ERGONOMIC COMFORT: The KZ Castor Pro In-Ear Monitor (IEM) offers a perfect blend of durability and elegance with its zinc alloy casing, adding a touch of luxury to every use. It’s ergonomic design, paired with soft, skin-friendly silicone ear tips, ensures a comfortable, snug fit, making long listening sessions feel effortless and enjoyable.", "HIGH-PURITY OXYGEN-FREE COPPER CABLE: The KZ Castor Pro IEM earphones stand for a commitment to quality and innovation. Featuring an OFC (Oxygen-Free Copper) core, the cable ensures precise, clear sound for an immersive experience. Wrapped in a durable, transparent TPE sheath, it’s built to last, resisting bends and pulls. Also easily manages music, calls, and voice commands with one-touch control, while the built-in microphone delivers clear, natural audio for seamless communication. KZ delivers the perfect mix of performance and reliability, crafted for music lovers who expect the best."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41azP282+mL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DQVCML9V	in_stock	2026-05-01 00:24:27.204506	2026-05-01 00:23:14.84019	f	Concept Kart	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a65bda2696c7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0DQVCML9V&bf=0.1&fbu=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0DQVCML9V&cuid=amazon_B0DQVCML9V&utm_source=dropiq_search&utm_medium=product_listing&utm_campaign=amazon	\N	\N	0.0000	0.50	0.00	0.00	f	0	f	0.50	f	\N	\N	f	\N
