nt sessions. Additionally, the noise-isolating design helps block out external disturbances, enabling a distraction-free listening environment. Whether you are working in a busy office, studying at home, or traveling, these headphones help you stay immersed in your audio content. Built with a durable and tangle-free cable, these headphones are designed for everyday reliability. The plug-and-play functionality ensures instant usability without the need for additional setup, making them a practical choice for users seeking convenience and performance in one package. If you are looking for affordable, high-quality USB-C wired headphones with mic, the ARTIX CL750 offers the perfect balance of sound, comfort, and functionality for daily use.	["USB-C Wired Connectivity for Modern Devices & Seamless Audio Transmission: Designed with a USB-C connector, these headphones provide stable and lag-free audio output for modern smartphones, laptops, tablets, and computers. Ideal for devices without a 3.5mm jack, ensuring high-quality digital sound transmission without interruptions or signal loss.", "Powerful Sound Performance with Balanced Bass & Clear Highs: Equipped with dynamic drivers and a wide frequency range (20Hz–20kHz), these headphones deliver crisp highs, balanced mids, and deep bass for an immersive listening experience. Perfect for music, movies, gaming, and calls with enhanced audio clarity.", "Built-in Microphone with Inline Controls for Easy Communication: Features an integrated microphone and inline remote control that allows you to manage calls, adjust volume, and control playback effortlessly. Ideal for work-from-home, online classes, meetings, and gaming communication without needing external accessories.", "Noise-Isolating On-Ear Design for Distraction-Free Usage: The on-ear ergonomic structure with soft cushioned padding helps reduce external noise and enhances focus. Whether you are working, studying, or traveling, the passive noise isolation ensures uninterrupted audio experience in any environment.", "Comfortable & Lightweight Build for Long Listening Sessions: Crafted with soft memory foam, fabric, and adjustable headband, these headphones provide a secure and comfortable fit for extended use. Lightweight design minimizes ear fatigue, making them suitable for daily use, office work, and entertainment.", "Durable, Tangle-Free Cable with Plug & Play Convenience: Built with a strong and tangle-free cable, these headphones ensure long-lasting durability and hassle-free usage. The plug-and-play feature eliminates the need for installation, making them easy to use across multiple devices instantly."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RzUT9ScpL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DP9WQNVQ	in_stock	2026-05-01 00:24:27.210641	2026-05-01 00:23:14.848723	f	ARTIX	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a65bda2696c7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0DP9WQNVQ&bf=0.1&fbu=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0DP9WQNVQ&cuid=amazon_B0DP9WQNVQ&utm_source=dropiq_search&utm_medium=product_listing&utm_campaign=amazon	\N	\N	0.0000	0.50	0.00	0.00	f	0	f	0.50	f	\N	\N	f	\N
