s, midrange, and treble ranges, effectively identify and eliminate noise in the earphone through digital signal processing. This allows you to transmit the fine nuances of music and instruments more clearly for an immersive musical experience. AAC/SBC codec support ensures smooth audio synchronization with the earbuds, minimizing audio and video lag. Audio and video synchronization plays an important role especially when enjoying content such as movies and games. Stable Wear, Gentle Fit for Ears: The K6 OWS earphones are over-the-ear type. Designed to fit behind the earlobe or the shape of the ear. Therefore, earphones won't fall off even during strenuous activities such as running or cycling, and provide a secure fit. Placed on the outside of the ear, less internal pressure or seal for a more natural acoustic experience. Easy to use even for those who wear glasses. In addition, the earbuds weigh only 0.4 oz (10 g) per ear, and the part that touches the skin is made of silicone material, reducing the burden on your ears. Multi-point connection, ENC call noise cancellation: Supports stress-free multi-point connections that can be connected to two devices simultaneously, such as music on your smartphone, or conference on your PC, etc. Equipped with ENC call noise cancellation to effectively reduce outside noise and related noise. Enjoy clear calls without disturbing your earphone calls from outside noise or traffic noise. (Touch control and can be used with just one ear) Equipped with a touch control function, so you can easily operate it with a light touch of your fingertips. Touch control intuitively plays basic operations such as play/pause music, forward/reject calls, and more. Supports single or binaural use. Single ear mode allows you to share music and movies with your lover or best friend. Binaural mode allows you to enjoy realistic experience. IPX5 Waterproof and Useful for Sports: These K6 OWS earphones with IPX5 waterproof feature are resistant to daily rai