fort for extended wear, perfect for long runs or gym sessions.", "🎙️ Experience Unparalleled Purity: Featuring Quad Mic PureVoice ENC Technology, every conversation is delivered with crystal-clear precision, ensuring that every word is heard distinctly. Our Wind Noise Reduction Technology further enhances clarity by eliminating background noise, making Buds Liberty ideal for crowded environments or outdoor use. Stay connected seamlessly with uninterrupted conversations wherever life takes you.", "🔗 Seamless Connectivity and Elegant Design: Experience seamless connectivity with Bluetooth 5.4, ensuring a stable and efficient connection. Enjoy the sleek dual-tone finish of Buds Liberty, combining matte and metallic accents for a sophisticated look. The elegant design is complemented by 1-step pairing, making it effortless to connect and enjoy your music instantly.", "🌐 Smart Assistant Integration: Stay connected and in control with Google and Siri Assistant support on Buds Liberty. Easily access your favorite voice assistants for hands-free commands, making it simple to manage your day, get directions, or control your music without lifting a finger. Enjoy seamless interaction with your smart devices for an enhanced listening experience.", "🛡️12-Months Warranty, 350+ Service Points: Enjoy peace of mind with our 12-months warranty, assuring quality and customer satisfaction. Our vast service network of 350+ points ensures convenient and accessible support wherever you are. Experience reliable after-sales service and enjoy your earbuds with confidence, knowing we have you covered."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GKx1WZ3AL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0D5R4L2XD	in_stock	2026-02-03 16:42:58.094831	2026-01-30 01:42:35.300253	f	truke	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a65bda2696c7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0D5R4L2XD&bf=0.1&fbu=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0D5R4L2XD&cuid=amazon_B0D5R4L2XD&utm_source=dropiq_searc