s with a 2-year warranty. Jabra Technology for Life’s new rhythm. Whatever you’ve got going on, we’ve got just the thing. So find your rhythm and start enjoying life on your own terms.	["HANDS-FREE — Roam while on a call with a wireless connection range of up to 30 meters/98 feet from your laptop, mobile phone and tablet. Plus, this hands-free headset lets you stay connected to 2 devices at once with its Dual Connectivity feature.", "MINIMIZE DISRUPTIONS — With up to 12 hours of battery life, and an integrated red LED light to signal when you are on a call, this Jabra noise cancelling headset keeps interruptions to a minimum during online meetings and beyond.", "IDEAL FOR COLLABORATING — This Jabra headset is fully compatible with Unified Communications platforms such as Avaya, Unify, Cisco and more. Additionally, the call control feature on this on-ear headphone, lets you adjust the volume or mute as desired.", "PREPARED FOR THE FUTURE — Download Jabra Direct to ensure your wireless, Bluetooth headphones always have the latest features. Thanks to the easy-to-use Direct Dashboard, staying up to date has never been easier.", "IN THE BOX — 1x Jabra Evolve 65 SE Wireless Stereo Headset with Link 380 USB-A Adapter, USB Charging Cable, Neoprene Pouch, and Safety Leaflet. Headset Weight: 310g / 10.93oz, Color : Black. Comes in a retail box."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ga70Q6-HL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0B7893NLS	in_stock	2026-02-03 16:42:57.975485	2026-01-30 01:42:35.193605	f	Jabra	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a65bda2696c7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0B7893NLS&bf=0.1&fbu=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0B7893NLS&cuid=amazon_B0B7893NLS&utm_source=dropiq_search&utm_medium=product_listing&utm_campaign=amazon	\N	\N	0.6500	0.60	0.30	1499.00	t	12	f	0.55	f	Black	On-Ear	f	Headphones
