ultimedia. Whether you're in a competitive match or enjoying your favorite playlist, the KZ Gale delivers a premium audio experience without the premium price tag.", "ESPORTS-GRADE DUAL MICROPHONE FOR CRYSTAL-CLEAR COMMUNICATION: KZ Gale in ear earphone features an advanced dual-mic array using two professional-grade 6mm omnidirectional condenser microphones. This setup delivers precise, high-definition voice pickup without needing to position the mic directly at your mouth. Compared to standard 4mm single mics used in most gaming headsets, KZ Gale offers dramatically improved sensitivity (from -42 dB to -26 dB), a wider pickup range, and significantly reduced background noise thanks to its redesigned microphone circuitry and acoustic structure. Whether you’re calling plays or chatting with your squad, your voice comes through loud and clear every time.", "HIGH PURITY SILVER PLATED CABLE: KZ Gale comes equipped with a high-purity silver-plated cable that ensures clear, detailed audio by reducing signal loss. Paired with a 0.75mm 2-pin connector, it allows easy cable replacement or upgrades whether for durability, performance, or switching to wireless with a Bluetooth module.", "DESIGNED FOR COMFORT, BUILT FOR BATTLE: KZ Gale In ear monitor is designed for long gaming sessions with an ergonomic shape and over-ear fit that stays secure, even during intense action. Paired with 3 sets of soft silicone tips, it ensures a snug, comfortable fit without the bulk of traditional gaming headsets.", "HEAR EVERY DETAIL, EVERY TIME: KZ Gale IEM wide 10Hz–20,000Hz frequency range lets you catch every footstep, whisper, and explosion with clarity. It helps you stay one step ahead by giving you precise sound positioning during intense gameplay."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Wc5q1m2NL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0FVY29B72	in_stock	2026-05-01 00:24:27.23606	2026-05-01 00:23:14.874754	f	Concept Kart	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a6