6d29f961-e5ed-4ec8-b0fc-a9741f49b7e2	CCA Concept Kart Phoenix Dual Magnet Dynamic Driver IEMs, 10mm LCP Diaphragm, Harman-Tuned, Silver-Plated Detachable Cable, Wired in-Ear Monitors for Studio (Slvr-3.5-Nomic)	B0GP6PXMBY	headphones	2609	\N	\N	The CCA Phoenix Dual Magnet Dynamic Driver IEMs are premium wired in-ear monitors engineered for musicians, audio professionals, and audiophiles seeking high-resolution sound and ergonomic comfort. Featuring a 10mm dual-magnet driver with a Liquid Crystal Polymer (LCP) diaphragm, these IEMs deliver deep, articulate bass, smooth mids, and crisp, extended highs with minimal distortion. Tuned to the Harman curve for natural, balanced sound, the Phoenix provides excellent clarity for mixing, performance, or casual listening. A high-fidelity silver-plated cable with 0.78mm 2-pin detachable connectors ensures clean signal transmission and upgrade flexibility. Crafted from aerospace-grade metal with ergonomic design and passive noise isolation, these monitors are built to withstand long sessions in the studio, on stage, or on the go while delivering immersive, professional-level audio.	["Powerful 10mm dual-magnet dynamic driver with LCP diaphragm delivers deep bass, clear mids, and extended highs with low distortion. Designed for musicians, audio professionals, and audiophiles, it offers fast transient response and balanced, high-fidelity sound for studio monitoring and everyday listening across all music genres.", "Harman Curve Tuning for Natural, Balanced Audio Signature: Expertly tuned to the acclaimed Harman target curve, the Phoenix IEMs provide a balanced, natural sound profile that enhances vocals, instruments, and ambient details without fatigue. Enjoy accurate low end, smooth mids, and crisp treble that preserves spatial cues and musical nuance, making these wired in-ear monitors ideal for mixing, stage performance, critical listening, and immersive everyday audio experiences.", "High-Fidelity Silver-Plated Cable with Detachable 0.78mm 2-Pin Interface: Equipped with a premium silver-plated quad-strand 156-core cable, the CCA Phoenix ensures fast, clean signal transmission with minimal interference or loss. The standard 0.78mm 2-pin detachable connectors provide easy cable replacement and future upgrades, giving you flexibility to customize your setup for performance rigs, portable DAC/AMP systems, or professional studio environments.", "Premium CNC Machined Metal Build with Ergonomic Comfort and Isolation: Built from aerospace-grade metal using advanced 5-axis CNC machining, the Phoenix IEM shells are robust, durable, and vibration-resistant. Their ergonomic shape—based on extensive ear geometry data—ensures a secure, comfortable fit for long sessions in the studio, on stage, or on the go. Excellent passive noise isolation keeps you focused on your music without distractions from external noise.", "Perfect for Stage, Studio & Everyday Listening: Whether you’re a singer, instrumentalist, audio engineer, streamer, or music enthusiast, the CCA Phoenix delivers a versatile performance that adapts to multiple use cases. From stage monitoring and mixing to commuting or home listening, these wired in-ear monitors produce a consistent, detailed, and powerful audio experience tailored to critical listeners and professionals alike."]	\N	\N	https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415FIL7RzzL._SY300_SX300_QL70_FMwebp_.jpg	https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0GP6PXMBY	in_stock	2026-05-01 00:24:26.828806	2026-05-01 00:23:14.237488	f	CCA	https://sovrn.co?key=0727a1b0f44aef88d463a65bda2696c7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0GP6PXMBY&bf=0.1&fbu=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.amazon.in%2Fdp%2FB0GP6PXMBY&cuid=amazon_B0GP6PXMBY&utm_source=dropiq_search&utm_medium=product_listing&utm_campaign=amazon	\N	\N	0.0000	0.50	0.00	0.00	f	0	f	0.50	f	\N	\N	f	\N
