p supports creating and saving custom profiles, enabling effortless transitions between personalized listening settings for a truly tailored audio experience.", "HIGH SENSITIVITY AND LOW DISTORTION: With an ultra-high sensitivity of 123dB and an impressively low total harmonic distortion of just 0.05% at 94dB, the Bunny IEMs deliver incredibly detailed sound across an extended frequency range of 8Hz-48kHz. This combination allows listeners to enjoy high-resolution audio with minimal loss in fidelity, making these earphones perfect for critical listening, professional use, and immersive gaming experiences.", "SILVER-PLATED OFC COPPER CABLE: The premium silver-plated oxygen-free copper (OFC) cable ensures pristine signal transmission with reduced resistance, preventing signal loss and unwanted interference. The flexible transparent sheath offers durability while preventing tangling, ensuring hassle-free use. This high-quality cable enhances overall sound clarity, allowing users to enjoy crisp highs, punchy mids, and a well-defined bass response without any compromise.", "ERGONOMIC AND DURABLE DESIGN: Designed with a blend of stainless steel and high-quality polycarbonate, the Bunny IEMs provide both long-lasting durability and lightweight comfort. The ergonomic shape ensures a secure, fatigue-free fit, even during extended listening sessions. Whether for daily use, studio monitoring, or gaming marathons, these earphones offer superior comfort while maintaining their stylish and premium aesthetic.", "VERSATILE CONNECTIVITY: Featuring a universal 3.5mm gold-plated plug, the Bunny IEMs are widely compatible with smartphones, tablets, gaming consoles, laptops, and professional audio equipment. This ensures seamless integration across various devices without the need for additional adapters. Whether you're an audiophile, a gamer, or a musician, the Bunny IEMs provide a reliable and high-quality wired connection for an uninterrupted listening experience."]	\N	\N	https://m.m